  "trivia": [
    "The concept and name of Owlhe was predicted in 2019 by dev Shuni#7105 (years before he started working at Crema Games) and Discord mod Lord Berial#8479, almost 3 years before it was revealed and introduced in the game. To this day it is unknown if Crema Games already had this idea or took it because it seemed good.",
    "Owlhe is one of four Temtem that change one of the types their pre-evolved form has upon evolving. In this case, swapping Mental for Wind. The others are Barnshe, Loatle, and Waspeen."
